  "title": "Jeweled Crunchy Turkish Chicken Pilaf",
  "description": "A funky and crumbly one-pot Turkish dish featuring chicken stock and tandoor spices, friendly for all diets including Buddhist temple cuisine. This recipe combines the flavors of Turkey with a crunchy texture.",
